# Line endings
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Git stores text files with LF endings. A checkout converts them to the
# platform's own (core.autocrlf: CRLF on Windows, LF on Linux and in CI), and
# `biome.json` (formatter.lineEnding = "auto") expects exactly that, so
# `bun run format` / `bun run lint` pass locally and in CI alike.

# Binary assets — never run text or line-ending filters over these.
*.exe   binary
*.dll   binary
*.wasm  binary
*.node  binary
*.gguf  binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary

# Generated lockfile — keep it out of diffs and language stats.
bun.lock  -diff linguist-generated
